<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#08281F;">Order {{orderReference}} is paid</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We verified a {{routeLabel}} payment of <strong>{{amount}}</strong> for order {{orderReference}}{{#if customerName}} from {{customerName}}{{/if}}. It is safe to fulfil this order.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#4E6259;">Payment confirmed does not mean the money is in your bank yet. Settlement status is shown on the Settlements page.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;">
  <a href="{{link}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#08281F;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:12px;">View order</a>
</p>
